  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity enhancement in complement of Climate Change Adaptation Framework   and Strengthen Climate Resilience in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aiming to enhance Vietnam&apos;s climate change adaptation capacity and climate resilience, this project involves implementing national and local-level climate change risk assessments and advancing the development of a supporting assessment tool through to its stabilization. It proposes institutional improvement measures based on policy analysis and consulting for the national adaptation system and key sectors (e.g., water resources, ecosystems). The project supports establishing adaptation governance and the formulation and implementation of adaptation plans in pilot provinces (such as Lam Dong, Quang Binh). Furthermore, it conducts multi-layered capacity building training for central and local government officials and carries out community awareness activities alongside the installation of small-scale climate adaptation infrastructure and related training.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative aims to enhance Vietnam&apos;s climate change adaptability and disaster management capabilities, and strengthen climate resilience. This will be achieved by developing advanced climate change risk assessment tools to support the establishment of practical, local-level climate change adaptation plans, strengthening the climate change adaptation capacity of central and local government officials, and raising community awareness.&#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xc815;&#xbd80; &#xbc0f; &#xc9c0;&#xc790;&#xccb4;&#xc758; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xc801;&#xc751; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xacfc;&#xd559;&#xc801; &#xadfc;&#xac70; &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xc758;&#xc0ac;&#xacb0;&#xc815; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; ,&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;(&#xb7fc;&#xb3d9;&#xc131;, &#xaf5d;&#xbe48;&#xc131;) &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xc801;&#xc751;&#xb825; &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
  </description>
